---
const { settings } = Astro.props
---

<footer class="tri-footer" id="footer">
  <div class="tri-footer__inner">
    <div class="tri-footer__brand">
      <a href="#top" aria-label="페이지 상단으로">
        <img src="/logo.png" alt="TRIATO" />
      </a>
      <p>행동이 시작되는 곳. AI 속도와 사람의 판단으로 프로젝트를 끝까지 굴립니다.</p>
      <small>© 2026 TRIATO.</small>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4>Menu</h4>
      <ul>
        {settings.nav.map((item: { link: string; title: string }) => (
          <li><a href={item.link}>{item.title}</a></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4>Contact</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="mailto:bjho@triato.co.kr">bjho@triato.co.kr</a></li>
        <li><a href="tel:01072071394">010-7207-1394</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h4>Company</h4>
      <ul>
        <li>대표 호병준</li>
        <li>Seoul, Korea</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .tri-footer {
    background: #000;
    color: #f5f5f7;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .tri-footer__inner {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 52px 0 64px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr .7fr .9fr .7fr;
    gap: 42px;
  }

  .tri-footer img {
    width: 128px;
    height: auto;
    filter: brightness(0) invert(1);
  }

  .tri-footer p {
    max-width: 360px;
    margin: 18px 0 16px;
    color: rgba(245,245,247,.56);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .tri-footer small,
  .tri-footer li,
  .tri-footer a {
    color: rgba(245,245,247,.48);
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .tri-footer h4 {
    margin: 3px 0 18px;
    color: rgba(245,245,247,.84);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .tri-footer ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .tri-footer a { transition: color .2s ease; }
  .tri-footer a:hover { color: #fff; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .tri-footer__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .tri-footer__brand { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .tri-footer__inner { width: min(100% - 28px, 1180px); grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
